# Preview harness

## `composeSrcDoc`

- Pure function; fully unit-tested
- Inject specimen CSS **byte-identical** — no prefix, escape, or rewrite
- `data-force-reduced-motion="true"` on `<html>` when force mode is on
- Optional `scaffold` wraps HTML via `{{specimen}}` or concatenation
- Always include the postMessage control script: `{ type: 'playback', rate }`, `{ type: 'restart' }` via `document.getAnimations()`

## `PreviewFrame`

- `<iframe srcdoc={…} sandbox="allow-scripts" title={`Preview: ${label}`}>`
- Recompose srcdoc only when inputs change (memoize) — never on every render
- Scale with `transform` when the container is narrower than the frame width
- Prefer `tabIndex={-1}` on the iframe when a plate wrapper owns focus order

## `ControlStrip`

- Emits a plain `HarnessControls` state object
- Owns **no** iframe / postMessage logic — parent wires restart via ref
